<main class="main">
    <h1 class="heading">Connecting Shippers to Freight Services</h1>
</main>

<section class="about" id="first-about">
    <div class="content">
        <div class="title">
            <span>Benefits of Using Freight Hub Central</span>
        </div>

        <div class="boxes">
            <div class="box">
                <div class="topic">
                    Shippers
                </div>
                <p>
                    Ability to select service providers based on location (to / from), types of services, types of load, and other factors
                    <div>
                    No need for back & forth emails to find who can accomodate your needs
                </p>
                <p>
                    Send your RFQ to multiple service providers with one click
                </p>
                <p>
                    Receive multiple QUOTES from different service providers and compare them side by side in one place
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="box">
                <div class="topic">
                    Service Providers
                </div>
                <p>
                    Be part of a larger, international list of customers looking for freight providers
                </p>
                <p>
                    Receive RFQ's, send quotes, and get conformation; all in one place
                </p>
                <p>
                    Never drive empty, pick and haul on your way to a destination or on your way home
                </p>
            </div>

        </div>
    </div>

</section>